  "solutions": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "Pain001 適合哪些人",
      "description": "資金管理、CFO 與董事會、付款作業、工程與 AI：以您的語彙描述問題、Pain001 帶來的改變，以及您的下一步，每個角色 150 字。",
      "eyebrow": "適用對象",
      "deck": "四種角色、四套語彙、一條管線。先找到您的問題，再找到下一步。"
    },
    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首頁</a>",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目錄",
      "<a href=\"#treasury-finance\">Treasury &amp; finance</a>": "<a href=\"#treasury-finance\">資金管理與財務</a>",
      "<a href=\"#cfo-board\">CFO &amp; board</a>": "<a href=\"#cfo-board\">CFO 與董事會</a>",
      "<a href=\"#payment-operations\">Payment operations</a>": "<a href=\"#payment-operations\">付款作業</a>",
      "<a href=\"#engineering-ai\">Engineering &amp; AI</a>": "<a href=\"#engineering-ai\">工程與 AI</a>",
      "Treasury &amp; finance<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#treasury-finance\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Treasury &amp; finance\">#</a>": "資金管理與財務<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#treasury-finance\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Treasury &amp; finance\">#</a>",
      "Your bank rejects files for reasons your ERP never warned you about: a transposed IBAN digit, a control total that no longer matches, an address format that stopped being acceptable. Pain001 makes those failures happen at your desk instead. Every file is proven against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD) before submission, and the <a href=\"/payments/\">payment-lifecycle guide</a> shows where each check sits between origination and reconciliation. Start with the <a href=\"/glossary/\">glossary</a> if the vocabulary is new; the plain-English definitions were written for your side of the desk, not the engineers'.": "您的銀行退回檔案的理由，ERP 從未事先警告：IBAN 數字對調、控制總額不再相符、地址格式不再被接受。Pain001 讓這些失敗提前在您的桌面現形：每個檔案在提交前皆依銀行官方規則手冊（ISO 20022 XSD）獲得證明，<a href=\"/payments/\">付款生命週期指南</a>並展示每項檢查在發動與對帳之間的位置。若這些詞彙對您仍屬陌生，請從<a href=\"/glossary/\">詞彙表</a>入手；那些淺白的定義是為您這一側的辦公桌而寫，而非為工程師。",
      "CFO &amp; board<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#cfo-board\" aria-label=\"Link to section: CFO &amp; board\">#</a>": "CFO 與董事會<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#cfo-board\" aria-label=\"Link to section: CFO &amp; board\">#</a>",
      "Two numbers frame the decision. <strong>By December 2026</strong>: when Swift will publish the new date for rejecting cross-border payments with unstructured addresses, a requirement it deferred in August 2026 but did not drop (<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>). The exposure lives in your customer master data, not your bank connection. <strong>€10,000–30,000 per year</strong>: the public list price of the nearest commercial translation SDK, against Pain001's permanent zero at any scale under open licences. The governance questions (auditability, data locality, supply-chain evidence) are answered with artefacts, not assurances: published <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>, <a href=\"/security.txt\">security policy</a>, and processing that never leaves your infrastructure. The <a href=\"/executive-brief/\">one-page executive brief</a> is written to be forwarded.": "兩個數字框定了這項決策。<strong>2026年12月之前</strong>：Swift 將公布拒收非結構化地址跨境付款的新日期。這項要求已於 2026年8月延後，但並未取消（<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>）。曝險存在於您的客戶主檔資料，而非您的銀行連線。<strong>每年 €10,000–30,000</strong>：最接近的商業轉換 SDK 之公開定價，相對於 Pain001 在開放授權下、任何規模皆永久免費。治理問題（可稽核性、資料在地性、供應鏈證據）以實證文件而非口頭保證作答：公開發布的 <a href=\"/sbom.cdx.json\">SBOM</a>、<a href=\"/security.txt\">資安政策</a>，以及絕不離開您基礎設施的處理流程。<a href=\"/executive-brief/\">一頁主管簡報</a>正是為轉寄而寫。",
      "Payment operations<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#payment-operations\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Payment operations\">#</a>": "付款作業<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#payment-operations\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Payment operations\">#</a>",
      "You live in the response files. Pain001 closes the loop end to end: <code>--dry-run</code> pre-submission checks that pass or fail cleanly in CI, scheme rulebooks (SEPA and cross-border) explained rule by rule, the <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">pain.002 reason-code reference</a> for decoding what came back, and parsers that turn bank responses and camt.053 statements into structured data your pipeline can route. The <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a> is the fastest way to see the failure classes it eliminates, including the one-click &quot;introduce an error&quot; scenarios.": "您的日常就在回應檔案裡。Pain001 端對端閉環：<code>--dry-run</code> 提交前檢查在 CI 中乾淨地通過或失敗，逐條解說的清算方案規則手冊（SEPA 與跨境），用於解讀回覆的 <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">pain.002 原因代碼參考</a>，以及將銀行回應與 camt.053 對帳單轉為您的管線可路由的結構化資料的剖析器。<a href=\"/try/\">瀏覽器示範</a>是了解它所消除的失敗類別最快的方式，其中包括一鍵「引入錯誤」情境。",
      "Engineering &amp; AI<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#engineering-ai\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Engineering &amp; AI\">#</a>": "工程與 AI<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#engineering-ai\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Engineering &amp; AI\">#</a>",
      "A typed Python API, a CLI with meaningful exit codes, a REST microservice, and plugin points for loaders, validators, schemes, and writers. <a href=\"/documentation/\">The technical reference</a> covers every flag and endpoint, and the code carries 100% line-and-branch coverage as a hard CI gate. If you are building with agents: <a href=\"/pain001-mcp/\">pain001-mcp</a> is the category's only Model Context Protocol server, with seventeen read-only tools your agents call locally, with editor diagnostics from <a href=\"/pain001-lsp/\">pain001-lsp</a> while humans stay in the loop.": "型別化的 Python API、具有明確結束碼的 CLI、REST 微服務，以及供載入器、驗證器、清算方案與寫入器使用的外掛點。<a href=\"/documentation/\">技術參考</a>涵蓋每個旗標與端點，程式碼並以 100% 行與分支涵蓋率作為硬性 CI 關卡。若您正以 AI 代理建置：<a href=\"/pain001-mcp/\">pain001-mcp</a> 是同類別中唯一的 Model Context Protocol 伺服器：十七個唯讀工具供您的代理在本機呼叫，並由 <a href=\"/pain001-lsp/\">pain001-lsp</a> 提供編輯器診斷，同時人員始終參與其中。"
    },
