    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首頁</a>",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目錄",
      "<a href=\"#the-problem\">The problem</a>": "<a href=\"#the-problem\">問題</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">The deadline</a>": "<a href=\"#the-deadline\">期限</a>",
      "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">What Pain001 does</a>": "<a href=\"#what-pain001-does\">Pain001 的功能</a>",
      "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">What it costs</a>": "<a href=\"#what-it-costs\">成本</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">The evidence</a>": "<a href=\"#the-evidence\">證據</a>",
      "<a href=\"#the-ask\">The ask</a>": "<a href=\"#the-ask\">請求</a>",
      "<strong>To print or save as PDF:</strong> use your browser's print function (⌘P / Ctrl+P). This page carries a print stylesheet that produces a clean single page, with no navigation, no footer, and links written out in full.": "<strong>如需列印或另存為 PDF：</strong>請使用瀏覽器的列印功能（⌘P / Ctrl+P）。本頁附有列印樣式表，可產生乾淨的單頁：沒有導覽、沒有頁尾，連結完整寫出。",
      "Read in: <a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">Español</a>": "其他語言：<a href=\"/fr/executive-brief/\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/de/executive-brief/\">Deutsch</a> · <a href=\"/es/executive-brief/\">Español</a>",
      "The problem<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>": "問題<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-problem\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The problem\">#</a>",
      "Banks reject malformed payment files. Every rejection costs a repair cycle; a repair that misses the day's cut-off costs a settlement day. The rejection reasons are knowable in advance, and therefore preventable.": "銀行會退回格式不符的付款檔案。每次退回都要付出一個修復週期；錯過當日截止時間的修復，則要付出一個清算日。退回原因可以事先掌握，因此可以預防。",
      "The deadline<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>": "期限<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-deadline\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The deadline\">#</a>",
      "<strong>Deferred, not dropped.</strong> In August 2026 Swift postponed the rule that rejects cross-border payments (CBPR+) with fully unstructured addresses, and the move from interbank MT101 to ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> version 9. The new timing comes by December 2026. The exposure still sits in customer master data, and dates already set remain: June 2027 (investigations), November 2027 (CHAPS purpose codes), November 2028 (MT statements). Sources: Swift and central banks, cited in full at pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends.": "<strong>延後，而非取消。</strong>2026年8月，Swift 延後了拒收帶有完全非結構化地址之跨境付款（CBPR+）的規則，以及銀行間 MT101 移轉至 ISO 20022 <code>pain.001</code> 第 9 版的變更。新的時程將於 2026年12月之前公布。曝險仍位於客戶主檔資料之中，已確定的日期維持不變：2027年6月（調查類電文）、2027年11月（CHAPS 用途代碼）、2028年11月（MT 對帳單）。來源：Swift 及各國央行，完整引註見 pain001.com/2026-iso20022-migration-trends。",
      "What Pain001 does<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>": "Pain001 的功能<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-pain001-does\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What Pain001 does\">#</a>",
      "An open-source suite that converts existing data (spreadsheets, ERP exports, legacy SWIFT files) into bank-ready ISO 20022 payment files, and proves each file against the bank's official rulebook (ISO 20022 XSD) <em>before</em> submission. It runs entirely on your own infrastructure: no upload, no vendor cloud, no telemetry.": "一套開放原始碼套件，將既有資料（試算表、ERP 匯出檔、傳統 SWIFT 檔案）轉換為銀行可直接受理的 ISO 20022 付款檔案，並在提交<em>之前</em>依銀行官方規則手冊（ISO 20022 XSD）證明每個檔案。它完全在您自己的基礎設施上執行：不上傳、無供應商雲端、無遙測。",
      "What it costs<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>": "成本<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#what-it-costs\" aria-label=\"Link to section: What it costs\">#</a>",
      "Nothing, at any scale, under open licences (Apache-2.0 / MIT). Commercial reference point: SWIFT's translation SDK is publicly listed at €10,000–30,000 per year.": "零成本，任何規模，採開放授權（Apache-2.0 / MIT）。商業參照：SWIFT 的轉換 SDK 公開定價為每年 €10,000–30,000。",
      "Support, an LTS line and private profile work for your bank's guideline are offered separately, without changing the licences: <a href=\"/enterprise/\">enterprise page</a>.": "支援、LTS 版本線以及依貴行指引進行的私有設定檔工作另行提供，授權條款不變：<a href=\"/enterprise/\">企業頁面</a>。",
      "The evidence<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>": "證據<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-evidence\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The evidence\">#</a>",
      "Published dependency inventory (SBOM) · 100% branch-covered code as a CI gate · independently scored supply chain (OpenSSF Scorecard) · WCAG 2.2 AAA accessible documentation · security policy with private disclosure. All verifiable at pain001.com.": "公開發布的相依套件清單（SBOM）· 以 100% 分支涵蓋率作為 CI 關卡的程式碼 · 獨立評分的供應鏈（OpenSSF Scorecard）· 符合 WCAG 2.2 AAA 無障礙標準的文件 · 支援私密揭露的資安政策。皆可於 pain001.com 查證。",
      "The ask<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-ask\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The ask\">#</a>": "請求<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#the-ask\" aria-label=\"Link to section: The ask\">#</a>",
      "Have your payments engineering team run the 60-second demo at <strong>pain001.com/try</strong>. It validates a sample batch and proves it against the official ISO 20022 schema, in the browser, with nothing uploaded. If it holds up, the installation guide takes minutes.": "請您的付款工程團隊在 <strong>pain001.com/try</strong> 執行 60 秒示範。它會在瀏覽器中驗證一個範例批次，並依官方 ISO 20022 結構描述加以證明，任何資料都不會被上傳。若通過檢驗，安裝指南只需數分鐘。"
    },
