  "pain-001": {
    "meta": {
      "title": "什麼是 pain.001？ISO 20022 貸記轉帳發起訊息",
      "description": "pain.001 是企業向銀行傳送、用以發起貸記轉帳的 ISO 20022 XML 訊息。本文說明其結構、.03 至 .13 各版本、一個經驗證的範例，以及它與 pain.002、pain.008、pacs.008 和 MT101 的差異。",
      "eyebrow": "ISO 20022 詳解",
      "deck": "企業向往來銀行發送、用於發起貸記轉帳的 ISO 20022 報文：它是什麼、如何構成、應使用哪個版本，以及一個可通過官方結構描述驗證的完整範例。"
    },
    "text": {
      "<a href=\"/\">Home</a>": "<a href=\"/\">首頁</a>",
      "ISO 20022 explained": "ISO 20022 解說",
      "The ISO 20022 message a company sends its bank to order credit transfers: what it is, how it is built, which version to use, and a complete example that validates against the official schema.": "企業向銀行傳送、用以發起貸記轉帳的 ISO 20022 訊息：它是什麼、如何構成、應使用哪個版本，並附上一個可通過官方結構描述驗證的完整範例。",
      "<span>Save page</span>": "<span>Save page</span>",
      "Contents": "目錄",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\">pain.001 in one minute</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\">一分鐘認識 pain.001</a>",
      "<a href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\">How a pain.001 message is structured</a>": "<a href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\">pain.001 訊息的結構</a>",
      "<a href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\">A complete pain.001 example</a>": "<a href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\">完整的 pain.001 範例</a>",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-versions\">pain.001 versions</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-versions\">pain.001 的版本</a>",
      "<a href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\">pain.001 compared with related messages</a>": "<a href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\">pain.001 與相關訊息的比較</a>",
      "<a href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\">Why banks reject pain.001 files</a>": "<a href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\">銀行為何退回 pain.001 檔案</a>",
      "<a href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\">How to create a pain.001 file</a>": "<a href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\">如何建立 pain.001 檔案</a>",
      "<a href=\"#sources\">Sources</a>": "<a href=\"#sources\">資料來源</a>",
      "<strong>pain.001</strong> is the ISO 20022 message a company sends its bank to order one or more credit transfers. Its full name is <em>Customer Credit Transfer Initiation</em>: &quot;pain&quot; is the payment initiation message family, <code>.001</code> is the message number, and the suffix, such as <code>pain.001.001.09</code>, is the version. It is XML, it is validated against an official schema (XSD), and it replaces bank-specific CSV formats and the SWIFT MT101 text message.": "<strong>pain.001</strong> 是企業向其銀行傳送、用以發起一筆或多筆貸記轉帳的 ISO 20022 訊息。其全名為 <em>Customer Credit Transfer Initiation</em>（客戶貸記轉帳發起）：&quot;pain&quot; 代表付款發起訊息系列，<code>.001</code> 是訊息編號，後綴（例如 <code>pain.001.001.09</code>）代表版本。它採用 XML 格式，依官方結構描述（XSD）驗證，並取代各銀行自訂的 CSV 格式與 SWIFT MT101 文字訊息。",
      "pain.001 in one minute<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 in one minute\">#</a>": "一分鐘認識 pain.001<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-in-one-minute\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 in one minute\">#</a>",
      "<strong>Who sends it:</strong> a company (the debtor, or an agent acting for it) sends it to its own bank (the debtor agent).": "<strong>由誰傳送：</strong>企業（付款人，或代表其行事的代理人）將其傳送給自己的銀行（付款人代理行）。",
      "<strong>What it carries:</strong> one or more batches of credit transfers, each with a debtor account, a requested execution date and any number of payments to creditors.": "<strong>包含什麼：</strong>一個或多個貸記轉帳批次，每個批次包含一個付款人帳戶、一個指定執行日期，以及任意筆數給收款人的付款。",
      "<strong>What comes back:</strong> the bank answers with <strong>pain.002</strong>, the Customer Payment Status Report, accepting or rejecting the file or individual transactions with ISO reason codes.": "<strong>回覆什麼：</strong>銀行以 <strong>pain.002</strong>（客戶付款狀態報告）回覆，使用 ISO 原因代碼接受或拒絕整個檔案或個別交易。",
      "<strong>What happens next:</strong> once accepted, the bank turns each instruction into interbank messages such as <strong>pacs.008</strong>, which the company never sees.": "<strong>之後會發生什麼：</strong>一經受理，銀行會將每筆指示轉換為 <strong>pacs.008</strong> 等銀行間訊息，企業不會看到這些訊息。",
      "<strong>Where it is used:</strong> SEPA credit transfers under the EPC rulebooks, cross-border payments on Swift under CBPR+ (<code>pain.001.001.09</code>), and many domestic schemes. Pain001's <a href=\"/example-corpus/\">example corpus</a> covers 42 scenarios across 17 markets.": "<strong>使用情境：</strong>遵循 EPC 規則手冊的 SEPA 貸記轉帳、在 Swift 上遵循 CBPR+ 的跨境付款（<code>pain.001.001.09</code>），以及許多國內支付制度。Pain001 的<a href=\"/example-corpus/\">範例語料庫</a>涵蓋 17 個市場的 42 個情境。",
      "How a pain.001 message is structured<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How a pain.001 message is structured\">#</a>": "pain.001 訊息的結構<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-a-pain-001-message-is-structured\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How a pain.001 message is structured\">#</a>",
      "Every version shares the same three-level skeleton inside a <code>&lt;CstmrCdtTrfInitn&gt;</code> element.": "所有版本在 <code>&lt;CstmrCdtTrfInitn&gt;</code> 元素內都採用相同的三層架構。",
      "Level": "層級",
      "Element": "元素",
      "What it holds": "包含內容",
      "<code>&lt;GrpHdr&gt;</code> Group Header": "<code>&lt;GrpHdr&gt;</code> 群組標頭",
      "Message ID, creation timestamp, number of transactions (<code>NbOfTxs</code>), control sum (<code>CtrlSum</code>), initiating party": "訊息 ID、建立時間戳記、交易筆數（<code>NbOfTxs</code>）、控制總額（<code>CtrlSum</code>）、發起方",
      "<code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> Payment Information": "<code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> 付款資訊",
      "One batch: payment method, requested execution date, debtor, debtor account and agent, charge bearer": "一個批次：付款方式、指定執行日期、付款人、付款人帳戶及代理行、費用負擔方",
      "<code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> Credit Transfer Transaction": "<code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> 貸記轉帳交易",
      "One payment: end-to-end reference, amount and currency, creditor, creditor account and agent, remittance information": "一筆付款：端對端參考編號、金額與幣別、收款人、收款人帳戶及代理行、匯款資訊",
      "A file can hold several <code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> batches, and each batch many <code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> payments. <code>NbOfTxs</code> and <code>CtrlSum</code> appear at both the file and the batch level and must match the payments they count, which is one of the most common reasons a bank rejects a file.": "一個檔案可包含多個 <code>&lt;PmtInf&gt;</code> 批次，每個批次可包含多筆 <code>&lt;CdtTrfTxInf&gt;</code> 付款。<code>NbOfTxs</code> 和 <code>CtrlSum</code> 同時出現在檔案層級與批次層級，且必須與其計算的付款相符，這是銀行退回檔案最常見的原因之一。",
      "A complete pain.001 example<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\" aria-label=\"Link to section: A complete pain.001 example\">#</a>": "完整的 pain.001 範例<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#a-complete-pain-001-example\" aria-label=\"Link to section: A complete pain.001 example\">#</a>",
      "This is a single SEPA credit transfer in <code>pain.001.001.09</code>, taken unchanged from Pain001's <a href=\"/corpus-it-sepa-sct-single/\">example corpus</a>. It validates against the official ISO 20022 XSD. The parties, IBANs and BICs are fictitious.": "這是一筆 <code>pain.001.001.09</code> 格式的 SEPA 貸記轉帳，原封不動取自 Pain001 的<a href=\"/corpus-it-sepa-sct-single/\">範例語料庫</a>。它可通過官方 ISO 20022 XSD 驗證。其中的當事人、IBAN 和 BIC 皆為虛構。",
      "Try your own data in the <a href=\"/try/\">browser demo</a>: it builds a pain.001 file from a CSV and validates it against the official schema without the data leaving your machine.": "在<a href=\"/try/\">瀏覽器示範</a>中試用您自己的資料：它會從 CSV 產生 pain.001 檔案，並依官方結構描述驗證，資料不會離開您的裝置。",
      "pain.001 versions<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-versions\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 versions\">#</a>": "pain.001 的版本<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-versions\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 versions\">#</a>",
      "ISO publishes a new version when the message model changes. Banks and schemes each accept particular versions, so the version you send is the one your bank's channel documentation names.": "當訊息模型變更時，ISO 會發布新版本。各銀行與支付制度只接受特定版本，因此您傳送的版本應以銀行通路文件指定的為準。",
      "Version": "版本",
      "Notes": "說明",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.03/\">pain.001.001.03</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.03/\">pain.001.001.03</a>",
      "The long-standing SEPA and CGI workhorse; identifies banks with <code>&lt;BIC&gt;</code>": "長期以來 SEPA 與 CGI 的主力版本；以 <code>&lt;BIC&gt;</code> 識別銀行",
      "Maintenance versions used by particular channels": "特定通路使用的維護版本",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.09/\">pain.001.001.09</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.09/\">pain.001.001.09</a>",
      "The 2019 version CBPR+ selected for Swift; identifies banks with <code>&lt;BICFI&gt;</code>, adds LEI and UETR carriage": "CBPR+ 為 Swift 選定的 2019 年版本；以 <code>&lt;BICFI&gt;</code> 識別銀行，並可攜帶 LEI 與 UETR",
      "Post-2019 refinements": "2019 年之後的改進版本",
      "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.13/\">pain.001.001.13</a>": "<a href=\"/pain.001.001.13/\">pain.001.001.13</a>",
      "Published by ISO on 19 March 2026; adds an optional unique transaction identifier (<code>UnqTxIdr</code>)": "ISO 於 2026 年 3 月 19 日發布；新增選用的唯一交易識別碼（<code>UnqTxIdr</code>）",
      "The <a href=\"/compatibility/\">compatibility matrix</a> shows which versions Pain001 generates, validates and migrates between.": "<a href=\"/compatibility/\">相容性矩陣</a>列出 Pain001 可產生、驗證及相互遷移的版本。",
      "pain.001 compared with related messages<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 compared with related messages\">#</a>": "pain.001 與相關訊息的比較<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#pain-001-compared-with-related-messages\" aria-label=\"Link to section: pain.001 compared with related messages\">#</a>",
      "Message": "訊息",
      "Direction": "方向",
      "Purpose": "用途",
      "<strong>pain.001</strong>": "<strong>pain.001</strong>",
      "Company to its bank": "企業傳給其銀行",
      "Orders credit transfers (pushes money out)": "發起貸記轉帳（對外付款）",
      "<strong>pain.002</strong>": "<strong>pain.002</strong>",
      "Bank to company": "銀行傳給企業",
      "Reports the status of a pain.001 or pain.008: accepted, partially accepted or rejected, with <a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">reason codes</a>": "回報 pain.001 或 pain.008 的狀態：已接受、部分接受或已拒絕，並附<a href=\"/pain002-reason-codes/\">原因代碼</a>",
      "<strong>pain.008</strong>": "<strong>pain.008</strong>",
      "Orders direct debits (collects money under a mandate)": "發起直接扣款（依授權收款）",
      "<strong>pacs.008</strong>": "<strong>pacs.008</strong>",
      "Bank to bank": "銀行之間",
      "The interbank credit transfer a pain.001 instruction becomes": "pain.001 指示轉換而成的銀行間貸記轉帳",
      "Company or bank, over Swift": "企業或銀行，經由 Swift",
      "The legacy text &quot;Request for Transfer&quot; that pain.001 replaces. Swift deferred the retirement of the interbank MT101 relay in August 2026 (<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>); see <a href=\"/pain001-loader-mt101/\">MT101 to pain.001</a>": "由 pain.001 取代的傳統文字訊息 &quot;Request for Transfer&quot;。Swift 於 2026 年 8 月延後了銀行間 MT101 轉傳的停用（<a href=\"https://www.swift.com/news-events/news/swift-accepts-community-request-extend-structured-address-migration-iso-20022-payment-messages\">Swift</a>）；請參閱<a href=\"/pain001-loader-mt101/\">從 MT101 到 pain.001</a>",
      "The <a href=\"/glossary/\">glossary</a> defines the rest of the ISO 20022 vocabulary in plain English.": "<a href=\"/glossary/\">詞彙表</a>以淺白的語言解釋其餘的 ISO 20022 術語。",
      "Why banks reject pain.001 files<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why banks reject pain.001 files\">#</a>": "銀行為何退回 pain.001 檔案<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#why-banks-reject-pain-001-files\" aria-label=\"Link to section: Why banks reject pain.001 files\">#</a>",
      "A file can be well-formed XML and still be rejected. The checks stack up in layers:": "檔案即使是格式正確的 XML，仍可能遭退回。檢查會逐層進行：",
      "<strong>Schema:</strong> the file must validate against the official XSD for its version.": "<strong>結構描述：</strong>檔案必須通過其版本對應的官方 XSD 驗證。",
      "<strong>Data quality:</strong> IBANs pass their check digits, BICs are well formed, dates and amounts are valid, and <code>NbOfTxs</code> and <code>CtrlSum</code> match the payments.": "<strong>資料品質：</strong>IBAN 通過檢查碼驗證，BIC 格式正確，日期與金額有效，且 <code>NbOfTxs</code> 與 <code>CtrlSum</code> 與付款相符。",
      "<strong>Scheme rules:</strong> SEPA, CBPR+ and domestic schemes add their own constraints, such as the allowed character set or a structured postal address.": "<strong>支付制度規則：</strong>SEPA、CBPR+ 及國內支付制度會加上各自的限制，例如允許的字元集或結構化郵政地址。",
      "<strong>Your bank's profile and channel:</strong> each bank publishes its own usage guidelines on top of the scheme.": "<strong>您銀行的設定檔與通路：</strong>每家銀行都會在支付制度之上發布自己的使用指引。",
      "Pain001 checks the first three layers before the file reaches the bank and states plainly that the fourth is the bank's to confirm.": "Pain001 會在檔案送達銀行之前檢查前三層，並明確說明第四層須由銀行確認。",
      "How to create a pain.001 file<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How to create a pain.001 file\">#</a>": "如何建立 pain.001 檔案<a class=\"heading-anchor\" href=\"#how-to-create-a-pain-001-file\" aria-label=\"Link to section: How to create a pain.001 file\">#</a>",
      "<strong>From a spreadsheet:</strong> <a href=\"/excel-to-pain001/\">Excel to pain.001</a> turns an Excel or CSV payment list into a validated file.": "<strong>從試算表：</strong><a href=\"/excel-to-pain001/\">從 Excel 到 pain.001</a> 可將 Excel 或 CSV 付款清單轉換為經驗證的檔案。",
